WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Some adventures begin with a traffic signal.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Clouds doing their absolute most.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A road that deserves a whole playlist.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The landscape wins every argument.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And somewhere else to call home.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Save room for wherever comes next.
